Package: winrpa
Title: Native Desktop UI Automation and Input Control
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yee How", "Lau", email = "lauyeehow1986@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
URL: https://lauyeehow1986-hub.github.io/Winrpa/, https://github.com/lauyeehow1986-hub/Winrpa
BugReports: https://github.com/lauyeehow1986-hub/Winrpa/issues
Description: Automates desktop user interfaces from 'R' using native 'C++17'
    bindings via 'cpp11' to operating system accessibility and input layers.
    Wraps 'Microsoft UI Automation' on a dedicated multi-threaded apartment
    Component Object Model (COM) worker thread alongside multi-monitor Dots Per
    Inch (DPI) aware 'SendInput' injection, non-destructive clipboard
    transactions, and global hotkey emergency abort guards. Exposes a
    pipe-friendly selector Domain-Specific Language (DSL) for Robotic Process
    Automation (RPA) workflows, deterministic waits, and window capture through
    an Application Programming Interface (API) that also compiles cleanly on
    non-'Windows' platforms with informative stub errors.
